widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"1091\">Traditionally, a butler\u2019s pantry served as a space between the kitchen and dining room for staging meals and storing fine china, glassware, and silver. Today, it\u2019s evolved into a <strong data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1080\">luxurious secondary kitchen<\/strong> that adds:<\/p><ul data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1283\"><li data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1138\"><p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1138\">Additional countertop space for meal prep<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1180\"><p data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1180\">Discreet storage for small appliances<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1244\"><p data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1244\">Space for wine storage, coffee bars, or a second dishwasher<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1283\"><p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1283\">A clean, clutter-free main kitchen<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"1285\" data-end=\"1456\">Whether you want a <strong data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1334\">modern minimalistic pantry<\/strong> or a <strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1374\">traditional-style prep kitchen<\/strong>, we\u2019ll craft a stunning space that seamlessly integrates into your home\u2019s design.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d793cd2 elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"d793cd2\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f9c174f\" data-id=\"f9c174f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-ffd0d5a elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"ffd0d5a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-815d8b0\" data-id=\"815d8b0\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6dfb8d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6dfb8d5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"color: #808080;\">Our Complete Storage Design &amp;<\/span> <strong>Butler\u2019s Pantry Construction Services<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-5b91aee elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5b91aee\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div c